    "steam_appid": 3753910,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Lloid, a solo developer, and this game was a little passion project I built in my spare time.<br>You're <strong>alone</strong> in an <strong>abandoned mine</strong>, armed with nothing but a <strong>pickaxe</strong>.<br><br><strong>Mine</strong> through rocks, uncover <strong>rare minerals</strong>, <strong>sell</strong> what you find, and <strong>upgrade your gear</strong>... if you <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the <strong>darker</strong> it gets.<br>Strange things <strong>dwell below the surface</strong>\u2014and they don't like visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine. Progress. Fight.</strong> Discover what's <strong>buried in the dark</strong>.<br><strong>No timer. No mercy.</strong> Just you, your <strong>headlamp</strong>, and the <strong>unknown</strong>.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi everyone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I'm Lloid, a solo developer, and this game was a little passion project I built in my spare time.<br>You're <strong>alone</strong> in an <strong>abandoned mine</strong>, armed with nothing but a <strong>pickaxe</strong>.<br><br><strong>Mine</strong> through rocks, uncover <strong>rare minerals</strong>, <strong>sell</strong> what you find, and <strong>upgrade your gear</strong>... if you <strong>survive</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the <strong>darker</strong> it gets.<br>Strange things <strong>dwell below the surface</strong>\u2014and they don't like visitors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mine. Progress. Fight.</strong> Discover what's <strong>buried in the dark</strong>.<br><strong>No timer. No mercy.</strong> Just you, your <strong>headlamp</strong>, and the <strong>unknown</strong>.</p>",
    "short_description": "A Game About Mining Rocks is a single-player survival game where you mine rocks, gather minerals, sell them, and upgrade your gear to explore deeper. Reach the bottom to find a legendary crystal, but be careful something down there is waiting for you.",
